%% D12 - Testing life cycle. A defect is recorded, fixed, retested, and covered by regression before closure.
flowchart LR
    P["Plan tests"] --> D["Design cases"]
    D --> E["Prepare environment"]
    E --> X["Execute"]
    X --> Q{"Defect?"}
    Q -- Yes --> L["Log defect"]
    L --> F["Fix and retest"]
    F --> R["Regression"]
    R --> X
    Q -- No --> C["Close with evidence"]
